# Executive Summary

The conducted security audit targeted specific areas within the provided scope, focusing primarily on concurrency-related vulnerabilities across files containing complex concurrent operations. The scan results indicated that while no critical or high-severity issues were directly observed, there are medium-level concerns related to race conditions and Time-of-check-to-time-of-use (TOCTOU) vulnerabilities which can lead to subtle yet significant data integrity risks if left unchecked.

